---
description: When working with lists
alwaysApply: true
---

Use paginated-list from @/components
Always server side unless prompted otherwise

use Server side filters when applicable

Use Following variables for pagination
  $first: Int
  $last: Int
  $offset: Int
  $after: Cursor
  $before: Cursor

Default limit is 10

For list Items use CardListItem or CollapsibleCardListItem components.

refer to operational/smcr/reasonable-steps for pagination example on journal entries.
